    kalkDekningsbidragHowtoRow3Label:'3. Number of units and total CM',
    kalkDekningsbidragHowtoRow3Desc:'Total CM = CM per unit × number of units sold. This is the amount you have left after all variable costs, but before fixed costs.',
    kalkDekningsbidragHowtoRow4Label:'4. Fixed costs and profit',
    kalkDekningsbidragHowtoRow4Desc:'Fixed costs are independent of the quantity produced — rent, fixed salaries, insurance, leasing. Profit before tax = Total CM minus fixed costs.',
