    skattUttakHeroTitle: 'Withdrawal <em>taxation</em>',
    skattUttakHeroSubtitle: 'If you take something out of the business for private use, it is taxed as a sale at market value. See the tax for sole proprietorships (ENK) and AS in 2026. Everything happens locally in your browser.',
    skattUttakHeroEyebrowHome: 'Home',
