    kalkyleFaqKicker: 'Questions and answers',
    kalkyleFaqTitle: 'Common questions',
    kalkyleFaqQ1: 'What is the difference between markup and margin?',
    kalkyleFaqA1: 'Markup is calculated on the cost, margin on the selling price. A markup of 60 % gives a margin of 37.5 % — same price, two ways of expressing it.',
    kalkyleFaqQ2: 'Should I calculate with or without VAT?',
    kalkyleFaqA2: 'Do the calculation on prices excluding VAT (MVA). VAT is added at the very end and is not your income — you collect it on behalf of the state.',
