    kalkMarginF7: 'Incl. VAT = excl. × 1.25',
    kalkMarginFNote: '“Avanse is calculated as a % of the cost and is always higher than the contribution margin ratio, which is calculated as a % of the selling price.”',
    kalkMarginGuideKicker: 'How to calculate',
    kalkMarginGuideTitle: 'Markup and margin are not the same',
    kalkMarginStep1: '<b>Markup</b> is added <em>on</em> the cost of goods. If you buy in for 100 kr and add 60 %, the price becomes 160 kr.',
    kalkMarginStep2: '<b>Margin</b> is calculated <em>of</em> the selling price. The 60 kroner you earn are 37.5 % of 160 kr.',
    kalkMarginStep3: '<b>Calculate excl. VAT.</b> VAT is not your income — add it right at the end.',
