    kalkTilbudHowto1Head: '1. Material items',
    kalkTilbudHowto1Body: 'Enter a description (e.g. "Cement 25 kg bag"), the quantity and the price per unit. The subtotal is calculated automatically. Add more rows as needed.',
    kalkTilbudHowto2Head: '2. Labour items',
    kalkTilbudHowto2Body: 'Enter a description of the work (e.g. "Installation"), the number of hours and the hourly rate. The subtotal updates automatically.',
    kalkTilbudHowto3Head: '3. Markup type',
    kalkTilbudHowto3Body: '"On materials %" adds the markup to the materials total alone. "On total %" applies the markup percentage to materials + labour combined. "Fixed kr" adds a fixed amount.',
    kalkTilbudHowto4Head: '4. VAT (MVA) rate',
    kalkTilbudHowto4Body: 'Choose the VAT (MVA) rate: 25 % for most goods and services, 15 % for food and 12 % for passenger transport, culture and sport. Choose 0 % when the sale is zero-rated or exempt.',
    kalkTilbudHowto5Head: '5. Quote total',
    kalkTilbudHowto5Body: 'The result shows the quote total incl. VAT (MVA), the markup and the VAT amount. Materials, labour and the total excl. VAT are shown at the top of the calculation.',
    kalkTilbudHowto6Head: '6. CSV export',
