"Anleggsmidler eies og brukes over flere år — bygninger, maskiner og langsiktige investeringer. Omløpsmidler er kortsiktige og snus i driften innen et år — varelager, kundefordringer og bankinnskudd. Skillet kreves av regnskapsloven § 5-1.":"Fixed assets are owned and used over several years — buildings, machinery and long-term investments. Current assets are short-term and turned over in operations within a year — inventory, trade receivables and bank deposits. The split is required by the Accounting Act § 5-1.",
"Anleggsmidler eies og brukes over flere år — bygninger, maskiner og langsiktige investeringer. Omløpsmidler snus i driften innen et år — varelager, kundefordringer og bankinnskudd. Skillet kreves av regnskapsloven § 5-1.":"Fixed assets are owned and used over several years — buildings, machinery and long-term investments. Current assets are turned over in operations within a year — inventory, trade receivables and bank deposits. The split is required by the Accounting Act § 5-1.",
