"Faste avdrag, synkende renter. Høyere start, men lavere totalkostnad.":"Fixed principal repayments, falling interest. Higher at the start, but lower total cost.",
"Faste kostnader ÷ dekningsbidrag per enhet (salgspris − variabel kostnad), rundet opp til hele enheter. 100 000 kr ÷ (250 − 150) kr = 1 000 enheter. Så mange må du selge for å gå i null.":"Fixed costs ÷ contribution margin per unit (selling price − variable cost), rounded up to whole units. 100 000 kr ÷ (250 − 150) kr = 1 000 units. That is how many you must sell to break even.",
