"Før 1992 kunne kommandittister trekke fra selskapets underskudd på sin personlige skattemelding uten begrensning. Dette gjorde KS svært attraktivt for skatteminimering i shipping og eiendom. Etter innstramming av fradragsreglene (kun fradrag opp til innskutt kapital) falt populariteten kraftig.":"Before 1992, limited partners could deduct the company's loss on their personal tax return without limit. That made KS very attractive for tax minimisation in shipping and property. After the deduction rules were tightened (deduction only up to paid-in capital), it fell sharply out of favour.",
