"IPS gir 22 % skattefradrag opp til 25 000 kr/år, men pengene er bundet til 62 år. Vurder mot fri sparing i ASK.":"IPS gives a 22 % tax deduction on up to 25 000 kr a year, but the money is locked until you are 62. Weigh it against free saving in an ASK.",
