"Standardverdien tilsvarer ca. 46 uker (52 minus 5 ferieuker og 1 uke helligdager). Jobber du deltid, hjemmekontor eller turnus, bør du justere antall dager selv.":"The default is about 46 weeks (52 minus 5 holiday weeks and 1 week of public holidays). If you work part time, from home or shifts, you should adjust the number of days yourself.",
